---
caw: 1
kind: synth
name: Init synth
summary: A starting synth patch: two wavetable oscillators, a sub, a filter and a little reverb; plays a pattern's notes
---
// One line per part. Change a number, or delete a line to turn that part off.
// Settings left out take their defaults; caw check --code shows the code this becomes.
voices 8

// --- Oscillators: tables are sine, tri, saw, square, basic (morphs with pos) and pwm ---
osc a table saw level 0.7 unison 5 detune 0.15
osc b table basic level 0.4 pos 0.3 octave -1
sub level 0.3 shape sine octave -1

// --- Filter: lowpass, highpass, bandpass or notch ---
filter 1 lowpass cutoff 1800 res 0.25 keytrack 0.5

// --- Volume envelope ---
env 1 attack 0.01 decay 0.4 sustain 0.6 release 0.3

// --- Effects, in order; a line can also name an effect module of your own ---
fx drive amount 0.15
fx reverb size 0.5 mix 0.2
